              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe abantu ab'e Nineve, babalumbye. Oyo aja okumenhamenha ekibuga abatuuseeku! Mute abaisirukale ghaigulu ku kimante ekigumu ekyezungulwire ekibuga era mukuume enguudo edh'omu kibuga. Mwesibe mwenhwegule. Mwetegeke okulwana olutalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
