          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda afuga amagye akoba ati: “Bona eno, buti nze nfuuse muzigu y'oli iwe Nineve, era nja kwokya ebigaali byo eby'omu lutalo, n'empologoma dho edho ento dhija kwitibwa n'empiima mu lutalo. Nja kukutoolaku ebyo byonabyona bye wanhaga ku bandi, era tekaaba biragiro bya bakwenda bo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NAM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NAM.2.13"
            ]
          }
